            "review_title": "Review at MadamNga Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Curious22990673860\n1 contribution\n0\nA Review of Madam Nga Restaurant • My Experience at Madam Nga Restaurant • Madam Nga Restaurant: A Great Place for Loc\nMar 2026 • Business\nRestaurant Review – Madam Nga (Short Version)\n\nLast weekend, I visited Madam Nga Restaurant, a popular place in Hoi An.\n\nThe restaurant has a lively but comfortable atmosphere. It was quite crowded, but still clean and well-organized. I really liked the simple decoration.\n\nThe food was delicious. I tried cao lau, and it tasted very fresh and flavorful. The portion was reasonable for the price.\n\nThe staff were friendly and served the food quickly, even though the restaurant was busy.\n\nHowever, it can be noisy at peak hours.\n\nIn conclusion, I would recommend Madam Nga to anyone who wants to enjoy local Vietnamese food in Hoi An.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 26, 2026",
